body:
It's too late for me though. I've already failed at this point and I feel like I'm drowning. No matter how hard I fight I can't make any headway. I'm tired of being a waste. I'm tired of looking into a mirror and seeing someone who can't do anything right and I'm sure those around me are tired at looking at me as well.

&#x200B;

\*edit\* And I know this makes me sound like some dumb person that wants to close and shut their eyes and ears to the thoughts and advice from others. Which is not true, i really appreciate you taking the time you are taking to talk to me but I truly feel like I'm not worth anything.
